*  R = the ideal gas constant (8.822 mol/K)
*  T = temperature (in Kelvin).  We to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to to  8.822 L/mol·K
*  n = number of electrons in the half-cell reaction (in this case, 2)
*  Q = the reaction quotient

