   *  U (in kJ/mol) = (-0.000003025 g/mol) * (6.022 x 10²³ mol/g)
   *  U ≈ -18.2 kJ/mol

**Therefore, the lattice energy of CaCl₂ is approximately -18.2 kJ/mol.**

