* **Carbon Dioxide (CO2):**  C2H5(g) + (5/2)O2(g) → 2CO2(g) + 2.5H2(g)
* **Water (H2O):**  H2(g) + (1/2)O2(g) → H2O(g)
* **Ethanoic Acid (CH3COOH):**  C2H5O2(g) + 5O2(g) → 2CO2(g) + 3H2O((g)

