* **Moles of CO₂OH (ethyl ethanol):** Since 1 mole of CH₃COOH reacts with 1 mole of C₂H₅OH to to HSO₂OH and C₂H₅CO₂, the moles of C₂H₅CO₂ produced will equal the moles of CH₃COOH consumed.  Therefore, moles of C₂H⁵CO₂ = 0.667 mol
