**The Basics: What is the Higgs and Why Decay?**

* **The Higgs Boseng:** The Higgs boson is a spin-0 particle that mediates the Higgs force. This force is what gives mass to many matter-fermons (quarks and leptons) and force-forceons (force-medions) in the Standard-being-laws.
